li-16.1","local_name":"bob-cli-16.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-16","agent_clan_generation":"20260826100448","approve":true,"bead_id":"bob-cli-16.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-16[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Pomodoro sub-bullet moves and named Pomodoros[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]`<ctrl+shift+m>` on a Pomodoro sub-bullet moves that bullet — and, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]with a count, the next N sibling bullets — into another open [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Pomodoro in the same note, or into a new named Pomodoro created [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]just below the current one, and the Pomodoro glossary entry [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]documents named Pomodoros and this keymap.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]pomodoro_bullet_move.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/pomodoro_bullet_move.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-16[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-16/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pure named-Pomodoro model, discovery, and planner[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]pomodoro-move-engine[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pomodoro-move-engine: add the named-Pomodoro grammar, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]entry/bullet-context model, sibling target discovery with count and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]clamping, and the pure same-file move planner to bob-navigation-hotkeys,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]all exported and unit tested with no UI or routing change.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Picker, routing, and commit[/bold #D7AFFF]                                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]pomodoro-move-ui[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pomodoro-move-engine[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pomodoro-move-ui: add the destination picker rows and modal with typed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]create-new-Pomodoro support, route `Ctrl+Shift+M` to the Pomodoro move [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]when the cursor is on a sub-bullet, and commit the planned move as one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]guarded editor transaction with a reporting notice.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Docs, version, sync, and glossary[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]pomodoro-move-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pomodoro-move-ui[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pomodoro-move-docs: bump the plugin manifest, extend the bob-plugins [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]README, deploy with `bob plugins sync`, rewrite the Pomodoro glossary [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]strand to cover named Pomodoros and the keymap, and regenerate sase [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-16","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-16.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-7a15e1c34adb0a68b6b327f248a01a7f","started_at":"2026-08-26T14:05:24.977918+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"ba68805e85e93de49ce55854171e3dd1cd8fd2b4376c0ada49cf962f9a46c652","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-16.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"b33dc240c3d9c182710470390ccaa2f4937077fc0115f6ee8df8aa8f28423f45","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-16